Lo82n8W_text","default":"OB/GYN - 25+ Years in Women's Health"},{"type":"html","id":"ggr4dfJ0Al6_text","label":"ggr4dfJ0Al6_text","default":"<p>Rachel Nguyen</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggybK8gcXTm_text","label":"ggybK8gcXTm_text","default":"<p>BSc-Lead Nutrition Scientist</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggocHHH85XQ_text","label":"ggocHHH85XQ_text","default":"<p>Rachel leverages her extensive expertise in plant-based and probiotic science to calibrate FloraFresh’s dosage for maximum efficacy. Her rigorous testing ensures every batch delivers gentle, yet fast-acting results—free from artificial additives and harsh chemicals.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggUId-5hlXO_text","label":"ggUId-5hlXO_text","default":"<p>Dr. Claire Thompson</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggk0yAqjDlj_text","label":"ggk0yAqjDlj_text","default":"<p>ND- Women’s Microbiome Specialist</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggbEAamSq5Z_text","label":"ggbEAamSq5Z_text","default":"Rachel Nguyen"},{"type":"html","id":"ggWWM5BdcSU_text","label":"ggWWM5BdcSU_text","default":"BSc-Lead Nutrition Scientist"},{"type":"html","id":"gg3m-nNGlI7_text","label":"gg3m-nNGlI7_text","default":"Elizabeth Ross"},{"type":"html","id":"ggvYQchwS33_text","label":"ggvYQchwS33_text","default":"OB/GYN - 25+ Years in Women's Health"},{"type":"html","id":"ggtnBJYNYfR_text","label":"ggtnBJYNYfR_text","default":"<p>Elizabeth Ross</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggp3j1rju7V_text","label":"ggp3j1rju7V_text","default":"<p>OB/GYN - 25+ Years in Women's Health</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg1zRYdUeGn_text","label":"gg1zRYdUeGn_text","default":"<p>Dr. Ross contributes decades of clinical insight to refine FloraFresh’s blend of herbs, probiotics, and nutrients. She recognizes the importance of safe, natural support for women seeking relief from uncomfortable odors, irritation, and imbalances—so they can feel confident every day.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggvxO1V3s0i_text","label":"ggvxO1V3s0i_text","default":"<p>Dr. Claire Thompson</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggRuxYoO